      "side": 1,
      "message": "What if a user is allowed to vote on a label but the \"post review comment\" permission is explicitly denied/blocked for that user?\nAt least that combination of permissions is confusing and probably unnecessary.\n\nConsidering the main purpose of this change, to prevent spam, is it worth a new permission?\nI would propose to make let the new behaviour be the default and only provide a gerrit.config global setting to allow admins to keep compatibility (\u003d allow spam): gerrit.allowSpam \u003d true",
